license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A transparent Stata starter project that rebuilds a related set of formatted
  Microsoft Word tables from one parameter block. It includes synthetic data,
  logs, assertions, and an extension guide.
keywords:
  - Stata
  - reproducible reporting
  - Microsoft Word
  - research software
  - publication tables
